The generated package declares the variable Catalog, which the event type of stream
catalogs collides with. Every event type has the fields EventID, EventTime, IngestTime and
OriginRegion for the implicit columns, and the columns event__id, event_time_,
ingest_time_ and origin__region map to them (sql.md §3.2).
-- dynaflux/streams.sql --
CREATE STREAM catalogs (name String)
PRIMARY KEY (name);

CREATE STREAM visits (
    user_id        String,
    event__id      String,
    event_time_    DateTime64(3),
    ingest_time_   DateTime64(6),
    origin__region String
)
PRIMARY KEY (user_id);
-- want --
dynaflux/streams.sql:1:15: error DF1207
dynaflux/streams.sql:6:5: error DF1207
dynaflux/streams.sql:7:5: error DF1207
dynaflux/streams.sql:8:5: error DF1207
dynaflux/streams.sql:9:5: error DF1207
-- want-text --
dynaflux/streams.sql:1:15: error DF1207: catalogs: generated Go name Catalog for the event type of stream catalogs collides with Catalog, which every generated package declares
  hint: rename one of them, or set -- go:type on the stream
dynaflux/streams.sql:6:5: error DF1207: visits: generated Go name EventID for the field of column event__id of stream visits collides with the field of implicit column event_id of stream visits
  hint: rename one of them, or set -- go:type on the stream
dynaflux/streams.sql:7:5: error DF1207: visits: generated Go name EventTime for the field of column event_time_ of stream visits collides with the field of implicit column event_time of stream visits
  hint: rename one of them, or set -- go:type on the stream
dynaflux/streams.sql:8:5: error DF1207: visits: generated Go name IngestTime for the field of column ingest_time_ of stream visits collides with the field of implicit column ingest_time of stream visits
  hint: rename one of them, or set -- go:type on the stream
dynaflux/streams.sql:9:5: error DF1207: visits: generated Go name OriginRegion for the field of column origin__region of stream visits collides with the field of implicit column origin_region of stream visits
  hint: rename one of them, or set -- go:type on the stream
